---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import TrustBand from '../../components/TrustBand.astro';

const title = 'Tesamorelin Rx — truncal fat loss with muscle preserved | My4MLife';
const description = "Tesamorelin is a GHRH analog that restores your body's own pulsatile growth-hormone release — helping you lose the truncal fat GLP-1 leaves behind while preserving lean muscle. Free telemedicine consult, physician-prescribed.";
const canonical = 'https://www.my4mlife.com/rx/gh-peptide';

const rxSteps = [
  {
    title: 'Complete the health questionnaire',
    body: 'Five minutes, from your phone. No appointment, no waiting room.',
  },
  {
    title: 'A physician reviews',
    body: 'A licensed provider evaluates your history and goals.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Delivered to your door',
    body: 'Your protocol ships directly. Ongoing support included.',
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>

<section class="rx-section rx-section--top">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-eyebrow">Tesamorelin · Growth-Hormone Peptide Rx</p>
    <h1>Lose the belly fat GLP-1 leaves behind — and keep your muscle.</h1>
    <figure class="scene-figure">
      <img src="/images/scenes/muscle-active.jpg" alt="A person rowing a single scull across a calm lake at sunrise, mist rising off the water" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>The scale only tells you what left. This is about what stays — the strength you keep using it for.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<TrustBand />

<section class="rx-section rx-section--bottom">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-lead">
      Tesamorelin is a GHRH — growth-hormone releasing hormone — analog. It does not put synthetic growth hormone into your body. It signals your own pituitary gland to resume releasing growth hormone in its natural pulsing pattern. We position it hand in hand with GLP-1 because GLP-1 weight loss doesn't just take fat — it takes lean muscle along with it. Tesamorelin is built to run alongside a GLP-1 protocol and protect the muscle GLP-1 alone doesn't.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-body">
      Your telemedicine consult evaluates your candidacy for tesamorelin specifically. The physician reviews your history, your current GLP-1 use if any, and your goals, then determines whether tesamorelin is appropriate for you. This program is built to run alongside your GLP-1 protocol, not compete with it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<HowItWorks steps={rxSteps} />

<section class="rx-section rx-section--bottom">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <h2 class="rx-evidence-heading">What the evidence shows</h2>
    <div class="rx-evidence-list">
      <ul>
        <li>
          Two Phase 3 randomized trials (806 patients total) found visceral fat reduced approximately 15–20% at 26 weeks, maintained through 52 weeks.
          <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11365754/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          A 2026 meta-analysis of 5 randomized controlled trials, published in Obesity Research &amp; Clinical Practice, found visceral fat reduced 27.7 cm² versus placebo, with trunk fat and liver fat also reduced, and <strong>lean mass increased 1.4 kg</strong>.
          <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41545261/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Secondary analyses showed improved skeletal-muscle area and density even as visceral fat fell.
          <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25038357/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Tesamorelin is FDA-approved for HIV-associated lipodystrophy. Use for general truncal-fat and muscle-preservation goals is off-label and compounded, and is prescribed only when a physician judges it appropriate for that patient. The trials above showed body-composition change, not large scale-weight change — this is recomposition, not weight loss.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rx-section rx-section--bottom">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-price-line">
      <strong>Free</strong> — telemedicine consult with a physician in our network. Your physician may order baseline labs (for example IGF-1 and fasting glucose).
      <span class="rx-pay-note">Medication is billed separately after the physician writes your script.</span>
    </p>

    <a class="rx-cta-btn" href="/rx/gh-peptide/questionnaire">
      Start Your Health Questionnaire &rarr;
    </a>

    <p class="rx-disclosure">
      6 quick steps. Your card will be saved securely — no charge until a physician reviews and approves your script. If you're not approved, your card is never charged.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.rx-section { padding: calc(76px + 3.5rem) 1rem 5rem; min-height: 60vh; }
.rx-section--top { padding-bottom: 1.5rem; min-height: 0; }
.rx-section--bottom { padding-top: 1.5rem; min-height: 0; }
.rx-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 1.25rem; }
.rx-eyebrow { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
.rx-inner h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--primary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.18; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.62; margin: 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-price-line { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--primary); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.55; }
.rx-price-line strong { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.35rem; }
.rx-pay-note { display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.35rem; }
.rx-cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,184,148,0.25); transition: opacity .15s; }
.rx-cta-btn:hover { opacity: 0.92; }
.rx-disclosure { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.5; }
.rx-evidence-heading { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); color: var(--primary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.2; }
.rx-evidence-list { text-align: left; max-width: 640px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; }
.rx-evidence-list ul { margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
.rx-evidence-list li { font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.62; }
.rx-evidence-list li:last-child { color: var(--text-light); font-style: italic; }
.rx-evidence-list a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; margin-left: 0.25rem; }
.rx-evidence-list a:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
.rx-evidence-list strong { color: var(--primary); }
</style>
